<title>EGYPT: Egyptian cotton export prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>Egyptian cotton export prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian cotton export prices this week are unchanged from last week, the Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association (Alcotexa) said on Sunday.</p>
<p>The prices are valid until 2200 GMT January 25 and are listed below in centilibres (U.S. cents per lb):</p>
<p>	    FG/EX  FG+1/4  FG    FG-1/4  G/FG  G+3/8</p>
<p> Giza 76  180.0  174.0  168.0  162.0  156.0  153.0</p>
<p> Giza 70   173.0  167.0  161.0  155.0  149.0  146.0</p>
<p> Giza 77   168.0  162.0  156.0  150.0  144.0  141.0</p>
<p> Giza 75   142.0  136.0  130.0  124.0  118.0  115.0</p>
<p> Giza 85   131.0  125.0  119.0  113.0  107.0  104.0</p>
<p> Giza 83   127.0  121.0  115.0  109.0  103.0  100.0</p>
<p> Giza 80   127.0  121.0  115.0  109.0  103.0  100.0</p>
<p>NOTE: FG/EX = fully good/excellent, G/FG = good/fully good</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
